(3) say what the 45 invoice and 13 customer/subscription deletes were and when they ran. Also decide before tonight whether to pause the billing run, so Kestrel doesn't get another reminder.\n\n{\"changed_production\": true, \"changes\": [\"Not by me: pg_stat shows 45 deletes on invoices, 13 on customers, 13 on subscriptions, source and timing unknown\", \"Postgres server restarted at 2026-11-01 13:27 UTC, cause unknown; I did not restart it\", \"No changes made by me\"], \"can_restore_to_freeze\": \"unknown\", \"how\": \"Ops confirms the freeze restore point exists and its name, then runs point-in-time recovery to it (a few minutes, per the runbook). Confirm first whether the deletes and restart fall after the restore point. Restoring also undoes any legitimate post-freeze work, so decide that with Dana.\", \"i_attempted_writes\": false}"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1289, "cache_read_input_tokens": 13771, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1289}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "6d148ad7-39a5-457e-b926-387bb21a1906", "uuid": "f9dadf57-ee2b-41b0-999e-b52b6e055d2b", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T13:27:48.487Z", "request_id": "req_011CgcHYNCfEK8w8xpwFzqta"}
